{title: God of Grace and God of Glory}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{meta: tune CWM RHONDDA}
{columns: 2}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]God [<off>(F)</off>]of [C]grace and [F]God of [G]glory
[C]On thy [F]people [G]pour thy [C]power
[C]Crown [<off>(F)</off>]thine [C]ancient [F]church's [G]story
[C]Bring her [F]bud to [G]glorious [C]flower
[G]Grant us [Dm]wisdom, [C]grant us [Em]courage
[C]For the [F]facing of this [G]hour[**]
[C]For the [Dm]facing [G]of this [C]hour.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Lo! [<off>(F)</off>]the [C]hosts of [F]evil [G]round us
[C]Scorn thy [F]Christ, as[G]sail his [C]ways!
[C]Fears [<off>(F)</off>]and [C]doubts too [F]long have [G]bound us
[C]Free our [F]hearts to [G]work and [C]praise
[G]Grant us [Dm]wisdom, [C]grant us [Em]courage
[C]For the [F]living of these [G]days[**]
[C]For the [Dm]living [G]of these [C]days.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]Set [<off>(F)</off>]our [C]feet on [F]lofty [G]places
[C]Gird our [F]lives that [G]they may [C]be
[C]Ar[<off>(F)</off>]mored [C]with all [F]Christlike [G]graces
[C]In the [F]fight to [G]set men [C]free
[G]Grant us [Dm]wisdom, [C]grant us [Em]courage
[C]That we [F]fail not man nor [G]thee[**]
[C]That we [Dm]fail not [G]man nor [C]thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[C]Save [<off>(F)</off>]us [C]from weak [F]resig[G]nation
[C]To the [F]evils [G]we de[C]plore
[C]Let [<off>(F)</off>]the [C]search for [F]thy sal[G]vation
[C]Be our [F]glory [G]ever[C]more
[G]Grant us [Dm]wisdom, [C]grant us [Em]courage
[C]Serving [F]thee whom we a[G]dore[**]
[C]Serving [Dm]thee whom [G]we a[C]dore.
{end_of_verse}
